{"id":"vod_bf_50322","vodId":"50322","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"七魔剑支配天下","name_cn":"七魔剑支配天下","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全15集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230708-1/6bca52e7357dd7507ba6c9b5ca0241cf.jpg"},"summary":"舞台是名门金伯利魔法学校。在这所学校，毕业前有两成学生或残废或失踪，还有人发狂并最终死去。这就是所谓的“为魔所噬”——春天，奥利佛·霍恩来到了金伯利。他温和而理性，背后却有着若隐若现的阴影。他身边聚集起出身背景各不相同的少年少女，并与魔法师们尽可能地互相切磋。这些未来的魔法师们满怀希望地走过了学园的大门。然而，人称魔境的金伯利却对他们露出了危险的獠牙。与伙伴们邂逅，前往魔境的他将面临什么样的命运――于是，围绕“七魔剑”展开的故事，现在，开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:05:34","episodeCount":15,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojianzhipeitianxia/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/qimojian